      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "jamu",
      "rationale": "שבט kɔrɔ ye balen (n'ka kulu) ye; jamu (jamana-ka mɔgɔgolo) b'a kɔrɔ nɔgɔya Bamanankan na."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "dɔgɔya (inheritance)",
      "rationale": "Verse bɛ dɔgɔya jɛgɛn — fɛn min bɛ fara jamu dɔ kan walima ka bɔ a la."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "«Ni muso ninnu taara Israyel denkɛw ka jamaw la mɔgɔ dɔ la kɛ a cɛ ye, u ka dɔgɔya bɛna bɔ an faaw ka dɔgɔya la, ka fara jamu min ka dɔgɔya kan min bɛ u ye, o kan; an ka sanu taabolo ka dɔgɔya bɛna bɔ o la.»",
